/* 记账页：对话流 + 解析卡（本页唯一主角卡片） */
/* 底部弹层（识别结果 / 分类选择）抬到 tab 栏之上，否则保存按钮会被 tab 栏盖住。
   注意：parse-preview 是 .screen 的兄弟节点（挂在页面根下），
   变量必须声明在 page 上才能被它继承。 */
page {
  --sheet-bottom: calc(var(--tab-h) + var(--safe-b));
  --sheet-safe: 0px;
}

.screen {
  height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-color: var(--bg);
  /* 为自定义 tab 栏彻底让位：56px + 安全区 */
  padding-bottom: calc(var(--tab-h) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

/* ---------- 顶部品牌 ---------- */
.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  min-height: 88rpx;
}

/* 游客态：顶部「登录」入口（与「我的」里的登录按钮同一套样式） */
.nav-login {
  height: 56rpx;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--blue);
  background-color: rgba(76, 141, 255, .12);
  border: 2rpx solid rgba(76, 141, 255, .28);
}

.nav-login--hover {
  opacity: .7;
}

.brand__avatar {
  width: 64rpx;
  height: 64rpx;
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-color: rgba(76, 141, 255, .14);
  border: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
}

.brand__avatar-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.brand__avatar-txt {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--blue);
}

.brand__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
}

.brand__name {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: var(--text);
}

.brand__sub {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  margin-top: 2rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.brand__dot {
  width: 10rpx;
  height: 10rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: var(--income);
}

/* ---------- 对话区 ---------- */
.chat {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  padding-top: 32rpx;
}

.chat__inner {
  padding: 0 var(--page-x);
}

.msg {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}

.msg.is-ai {
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.msg.is-me {
  align-items: flex-end;
}

.bubble {
  max-width: 78%;
  padding: 20rpx 24rpx;
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  border-bottom-left-radius: 8rpx;
  background-color: var(--card);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--card-line);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--text);
}

.bubble--me {
  background-color: var(--blue);
  border: none;
  border-bottom-left-radius: var(--r-card);
  border-bottom-right-radius: 8rpx;
  color: var(--white);
}

.bubble__text {
  word-break: break-word;
}

.msg__time {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  padding: 0 4rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.renew {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background-color: var(--warn-weak);
}

.renew__text {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.bubble--typing {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.dot {
  width: 10rpx;
  height: 10rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: var(--text-3);
}

.typing__text {
  margin-left: 8rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

/* ---------- 解析卡（主角） ---------- */
.parse {
  margin: 8rpx 0 32rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
}

.parse__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.parse__title {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.parse__warn {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--warn);
}

.parse__amount {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  padding-bottom: 24rpx;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--line);
}

.parse__cur {
  margin-right: 8rpx;
  font-size: 40rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.parse__val {
  font-size: 96rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--text);
}

.parse__val.is-income {
  color: var(--income);
}

.parse__dec {
  font-size: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.parse__edit {
  margin-left: auto;
  align-self: center;
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
}

.parse__meta {
  padding-top: 8rpx;
}

.parse__row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--line-soft);
}

.parse__row:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.parse__k {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.parse__v {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: var(--text);
}

.parse__v .is-dim {
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.parse__cat {
  height: 44rpx;
  padding: 0 16rpx;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.parse__miss {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--warn);
}

.parse__pick {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.parse__foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.parse__actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 24rpx;
}

.parse__btn {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 96rpx;
}

/* ---------- 多笔汇总卡 ---------- */
.multi {
  margin: 8rpx 0 32rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
}

.multi__list {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

.multi__row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  min-height: 100rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--line-soft);
}

.multi__row:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.multi__row--hover {
  opacity: .75;
}

.multi__dot {
  width: 16rpx;
  height: 16rpx;
  flex: none;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.multi__main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
}

.multi__name {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: var(--text);
}

.multi__flag {
  height: 36rpx;
  padding: 0 12rpx;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--warn);
  background-color: var(--warn-weak);
}

.multi__sub {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.multi__right {
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.multi__del {
  width: 56rpx;
  height: 56rpx;
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.multi__del--hover {
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06);
}

.multi__amt {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
}

.multi__amt.is-income {
  color: var(--income);
}

.multi__total {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  padding-top: 12rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--line);
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.multi__total-val {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
}

/* ---------- 快捷短语 ---------- */
/* 横向滚动铺满屏幕：左右抵消容器边距，内层再补 16px 首尾留白 */
.chips {
  margin: 0 calc(var(--page-x) * -1);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.chips__inner {
  display: inline-flex;
  padding: 0 var(--page-x);
}

.chips__item {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  background-color: var(--card);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--card-line);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text);
}

.chips__item--hover {
  transform: scale(.98);
  opacity: .9;
}

.chips__dot {
  width: 16rpx;
  height: 16rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.chat__tip {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.chat__end {
  height: 24rpx;
}

/* ---------- 输入条 ---------- */
.inputbar {
  flex: none;
  padding: 16rpx var(--page-x) 24rpx;
  background-color: var(--bg);
}

.photo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.photo__img {
  width: 64rpx;
  height: 64rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
}

.photo__remove {
  margin-left: auto;
  min-width: 88rpx;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.ib {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.ib__field {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  border-radius: var(--r-btn);
  background-color: var(--card);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--card-line);
}

.ib__icon {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.ib__icon--hover {
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05);
}

.ib__input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 88rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: var(--text);
}

.ib__ph {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.ib__send {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--r-btn);
  background-color: var(--btn-off);
  transition: background-color .12s ease, transform .1s ease;
}

.ib__send.is-on {
  background-color: var(--blue);
}

.ib__send--hover {
  transform: scale(.98);
  opacity: .92;
}

/* ---------- 抽屉 ---------- */
.scrim {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 90;
  background-color: var(--scrim);
  transition: opacity .2s ease;
}

.scrim.is-drag {
  transition: none;
}

.drawer {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 91;
  width: 624rpx;
  background-color: var(--panel);
  transition: transform .24s ease;
  box-shadow: none;
}

.drawer.is-drag {
  transition: none;
}

/* ---------- 朋友圈单页模式（未登录介绍页） ---------- */
.single {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 30;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 48rpx calc(180rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background-color: var(--bg);
  text-align: center;
}

.single__logo {
  width: 132rpx;
  height: 132rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 36rpx;
  font-size: 56rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--white);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4C8DFF, #7C6BFF);
}

.single__title {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  font-size: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
}

.single__sub {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.single__list {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 56rpx;
  padding: 8rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  background-color: var(--card);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--card-line);
}

.single__item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
  padding: 26rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--line-soft);
  text-align: left;
}

.single__item:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.single__k {
  flex: none;
  width: 104rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--blue);
  background-color: rgba(76, 141, 255, .12);
}

.single__v {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.single__hint {
  margin-top: 40rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}
